Remote-first stratum CLI

Usage: stratumctl [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  health
  ls
  cat
  write
  grep
  find
  tree
  commit
  log
  revert
  status
  diff
  workspace
  change-request
  mount
  help            Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --url <URL>                          [env: STRATUM_URL=] [default: http://127.0.0.1:3000]
      --user <USER>                        [env: STRATUM_USER=]
      --token <TOKEN>                      [env: STRATUM_TOKEN=]
      --workspace-id <WORKSPACE_ID>        [env: STRATUM_WORKSPACE_ID=]
      --workspace-token <WORKSPACE_TOKEN>  [env: STRATUM_WORKSPACE_TOKEN=]
      --repo <REPO>                        [env: STRATUM_REPO=]
  -h, --help                               Print help
  -V, --version                            Print version
